o al nacimiento de Río Potrero de Castilla hasta el cerro Mataderos. ÁREAS JURISDICCIONAL POLICIAL EN KM2 La Jurisdicción de esta Dependencia Policial, tiene una superficie de aproximadamente 1.440 Km2. AREA DE JURIDICCION POLICIAL La Jurisdicción de la Sub. Cria La Caldera comienza de Ruta Nacional Nº 9 de | KM. 1616, al KM 1848 límite salta, Jujuy&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIM_SUR&lt;/b&gt;: Desde el punto de unión de los límites entre los Departamentos de Gral. Güemes y Capital, pasando por el paraje Mojotoro, Abra de Gallinato, cumbre de Gallinato, hasta paraje Wierna | a&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIM_ESTE&lt;/b&gt;: Desde el Río Las Pavas, pasando por paraje Lomas Peladas, abra del Toruno, Mesadas de Aserraderos, monte del Paraíso, Departamentos de Gral. Güemes hasta llegar al paraje Puente Negro&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIM_OESTE&lt;/b&gt;: Desde el paraje Wierna, siguiendo las orillas</description><Polygon><tessellate>1</tessellate><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-65.5478290,-24.4407593,0 -65.5464588,-24.4422279,0 -65.5450526,-24.4449299,0 -65.5347129,-24.4492009,0 -65.5302462,-24.4486228,0 -65.5277797,-24.4488973,0 -65.5239247,-24.4495905,0 -65.5210044,-24.4476064,0 -65.5186930,-24.4475991,0 -65.5168396,-24.4487217,0 -65.5162184,-24.4499892,0 -65.5148288,-24.4506901,0 -65.5134360,-24.4522373,0 -65.5133348,-24.4535324,0 -65.5122906,-24.4545869,0 -65.5100944,-24.4546856,0 -65.5072072,-24.4541473,0 -65.5061716,-24.4529802,0 -65.5066661,-24.4495352,0 -65.5062104,-24.4478410,0 -65.5059242,-24.4421976,0 -65.5056238,-24.4402218,0 -65.5047059,-24.4385260,0 -65.5033275,-24.4364056,0 -65.5013283,-24.4354116,0 -65.5002559,-24.4338563,0 -65.4970290,-24.4316592,0 -65.4714513,-24.4319952,0 -65.4491937,-24.4534181,0 -65.4382143,-24.4534835,0 -65.4416948,-24.4504285,0 -65.4413588,-24.4479941,0 -65.4402201,-24.4441814,0 -65.4377031,-24.4384593,0 -65.4329791,-24.4353737,0 -65.4201543,-24.4350078,0 -65.4190138,-24.4317239,0 -65.4165936,-24.4303394,0 -65.4131346,-24.4287391,0 -65.4115224