ORTE&lt;/b&gt;: limita con el canal de riego de la empresa “Río Juramento”, coordenadas -25.179331048417097, -64.07631479591616, jurisdicción con Cria 1° González (DDP5) | ) y 70 Km.(&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIM_SUR&lt;/b&gt;: con el canal de riego de la finca “Sahara Ranch jurisdicción con Sub Cría El Quebrachal (DDP5) -coordenadas -25.285413, -64.019081 | ), con esta línea imaginaria que es diagonal se concertó que el único paraje en el lugar denominado Puesto Amohate, jurisdicción con Destacamento Policial Nuestra Sra. De Talavera (DDP5)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIM_ESTE&lt;/b&gt;: le corresponde una línea imaginaria entre los 90 Km (&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIM_OESTE&lt;/b&gt;: limita con el río Juramento. Jurisdicción con el Destacamento Policial Orquera (DDP5)</description><Polygon><tessellate>1</tessellate><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-64.0909974,-25.1891550,0 -64.0908491,-25.1886184,0 -64.0910969,-25.1878018,0 -64.0928827,-25.1863277,0 -64.0934454,-25.1854082,0 -64.0937335,-25.1845207,0 -64.0942112,-25.1840279,0 -64.0946184,-25.1830351,0 -64.0947194,-25.1815749,0 -64.0953826,-25.1792309,0 -64.0965438,-25.1776061,0 -64.0964877,-25.1761796,0 -64.0961579,-25.1747139,0 -64.0962920,-25.1736463,0 -64.0961520,-25.1725751,0 -64.0962744,-25.1722559,0 -64.0964350,-25.1720084,0 -64.0968288,-25.1718709,0 -64.0978964,-25.1717057,0 -64.0986669,-25.1710959,0 -64.0996209,-25.1689937,0 -64.1000299,-25.1684522,0 -64.1006385,-25.1679496,0 -64.1012415,-25.1678115,0 -64.1022941,-25.1670959,0 -64.1037021,-25.1667129,0 -64.1045888,-25.1663597,0 -64.1048325,-25.1661441,0 -64.1055291,-25.1651323,0 -64.1059494,-25.1638617,0 -64.1061760,-25.1621512,0 -64.1067215,-25.1605541,0 -64.1071693,-25.1600859,0 -64.1077339,-25.1598380,0 -64.1092947,-25.1599308,0 -64.1097701,-25.1602650,0 -64.1102412,-25.1608908,0 -64.1115871,-25.1619287,0 -64.1124665,-25.1620493,0 -64.1131490,-25.1619486,0 -64.1143616,-25.1612349,0 -64.1154626,-25.1599730,0 -64.1162030,-25.1587065,0 -64.1168133,-25.1580945,0 -64.1