valle, desde Ruta Provincial Nº 26 por calle Joaquín V. González, continuando por calle Francisco Ramírez y Nicolás Avellaneda ex cauce del río Arenales, hasta el Puente La Unión | del Cerro Bola, final de la Avda. Ángel Vargas&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIM_SUR&lt;/b&gt;: Limita con la jurisdicción de Comisaria N° 5 B° Solidaridad, desde Ruta Provincial 26 por calle E. Viñal arteria que separa Bº Coposal de Bº Democracia, Bº Siglo XXI de Bº Libertad, Bº San Benito de Bº Convivencia, hasta calle Argentino Medina continuando por Av. Ángel Vargas que separa esta jurisdicción con la del Destacamento San Ignacio&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIM_ESTE&lt;/b&gt;: Limita&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIM_OESTE&lt;/b&gt;: La Ruta Provincial 26, sirve de límite con la Comisaría Nº 15 Bº San Remo, desde la intersección de ésta con la calle J.V González, hasta calle E. Villar</description><Polygon><tessellate>1</tessellate><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-65.3935429,-24.8223798,0 -65.3921056,-24.8244050,0 -65.3914085,-24.8251209,0 -65.3903782,-24.8257780,0 -65.3897238,-24.8253981,0 -65.3883291,-24.8232367,0 -65.3874850,-24.8230770,0 -65.3875475,-24.8242362,0 -65.3857678,-24.8242647,0 -65.3858301,-24.8275131,0 -65.3876098,-24.8274847,0 -65.3876410,-24.8291089,0 -65.3894208,-24.8290804,0 -65.3894053,-24.8282753,0 -65.3902978,-24.8306911,0 -65.3886617,-24.8307173,0 -65.3885884,-24.8323432,0 -65.3894831,-24.8323289,0 -65.3895455,-24.8355773,0 -65.3913254,-24.8355488,0 -65.3913471,-24.8366791,0 -65.3917023,-24.8366558,0 -65.3917354,-24.8367686,0 -65.3954396,-24.8360324,0 -65.4001373,-24.8354679,0 -65.4016409,-24.8350490,0 -65.4047561,-24.8349126,0 -65.4065918,-24.8352047,0 -65.4085990,-24.8353217,0 -65.4077547,-24.8401590,0 -65.4092181,-24.8401354,0 -65.4091867,-24.8385112,0 -65.4113914,-24.8384757,0 -65.4106945,-24.8373606,0 -65.4106945,-24.8319287,0 -65.3953760,-24.8214488,0 -65.3935429,-24.8223798,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark><Placemark><name>COMISARIA 4 - B° 