ESTE&lt;/b&gt;: , pasando el Paraje La Rinconada- Vº Los Álamos, siguiendo por margen derecho del Río Ancho hasta Ruta Prov. Nº 26- altura Km. 12 (Pje. La Candelaria). • | por Ruta Provincial Nº 26, desde altura km. 12 (Pje. La Candelaria), hacia el | a&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIM_OESTE&lt;/b&gt;: a | , pasando por Finca Los Pinos, Finca Belgrano (Ruta Prov. 21), Finca Mirse (Ruta Nac. 68), siguiendo por Ruta Provincial 49 (Camino a los Vallistos), hasta límite jurisdiccional con el Departamento Rosario de Lerma (Finca Bella Vista Prop. Sr. Berruezo). • | por línea departamental con Rosario de Lerma, desde Ruta Provincial Nª 49, (Finca Bella Vista), de</description><MultiGeometry><Polygon><tessellate>1</tessellate><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-65.2839306,-24.9980820,0 -65.2928422,-24.9979449,0 -65.2928724,-24.9995692,0 -65.3035663,-24.9994039,0 -65.3035966,-25.0010282,0 -65.3214199,-25.0007509,0 -65.3213893,-24.9991267,0 -65.3230061,-24.9991014,0 -65.3229118,-24.9988748,0 -65.3916475,-24.9876630,0 -65.3843085,-24.9725512,0 -65.3865196,-24.9722598,0 -65.4019926,-24.9688543,0 -65.4018787,-24.9604957,0 -65.4014169,-24.9516405,0 -65.4132678,-24.9459773,0 -65.4127965,-24.9429737,0 -65.4162320,-24.9415500,0 -65.4234343,-24.9417744,0 -65.4261931,-24.9438825,0 -65.4322698,-24.9496224,0 -65.4366090,-24.9527234,0 -65.4372949,-24.9514246,0 -65.4451158,-24.9510859,0 -65.4467918,-24.9523501,0 -65.4490239,-24.9523376,0 -65.4490809,-24.9525840,0 -65.4499343,-24.9528362,0 -65.4513149,-24.9524075,0 -65.4521158,-24.9522797,0 -65.4525460,-24.9524132,0 -65.4534622,-24.9529672,0 -65.4536772,-24.9532997,0 -65.4535517,-24.9547606,0 -65.4530770,-24.9554308,0 -65.4535983,-24.9566614,0 -65.4534177,-24.9575845,0 -65.4534655,-24.9585827,0 -65.4531835,-24.9591401,0 -65.4538437,-24.9602719,0 -65.4544601,-24.9609077,0 -65.4549597,-24.9607831,0 -65.4556282,-24.9609393,0 -65.4573486,-24.9604913,0 -65.4579902,-24.9600959,0 -65.4591138,-24.9600175,0 -65.4609225,-24.9610215,0 -65.4613498,-24.9