al | ,sigue por calle Buenos Aires límite municipal | hasta finca San Rafael ,desde allí continúa con línea imaginaria atravesando el Río Rosario ppr detrás de Finca Carabajal hasta Río Las Higueritas y finca del mismo nombre donde limita con Comisaria N° 2&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIM_ESTE&lt;/b&gt;: ,continúa por calle Luis Guiemew límite municipal | limita connComisaria N° 5 La Merced ppr Ruta Provincial 49 correspondiendo el límite municipal | a la nueva dependencia policial&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;LIM_OESTE&lt;/b&gt;: límite con jurisdicción de Comisaria N°2 desde límite municipal | de Avda. San Martín hasta su culminación, continuando por calle Sarmiento límite municipal | siguiendo por calle Mariano Saravia límite municipal</description><Polygon><tessellate>1</tessellate><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-65.5322010,-24.9208221,0 -65.5280737,-24.9212369,0 -65.5292777,-24.9223721,0 -65.5271105,-24.9231171,0 -65.5284693,-24.9332723,0 -65.5291802,-24.9345070,0 -65.5204325,-24.9349866,0 -65.5215397,-24.9365126,0 -65.5233603,-24.9386208,0 -65.5286671,-24.9440024,0 -65.5304081,-24.9461828,0 -65.5322193,-24.9496690,0 -65.5329842,-24.9507949,0 -65.5381622,-24.9505764,0 -65.5395174,-24.9582013,0 -65.5359940,-24.9585471,0 -65.5374430,-24.9627729,0 -65.5397950,-24.9624834,0 -65.5408612,-24.9659821,0 -65.5386634,-24.9662271,0 -65.5415085,-24.9721423,0 -65.5376297,-24.9742715,0 -65.5324326,-24.9759231,0 -65.5307848,-24.9771162,0 -65.5291353,-24.9787373,0 -65.5231556,-24.9830408,0 -65.5165647,-24.9874277,0 -65.5159064,-24.9876156,0 -65.5149180,-24.9882355,0 -65.5167832,-24.9939470,0 -65.5184450,-24.9981534,0 -65.5224743,-25.0053435,0 -65.5253145,-25.0115147,0 -65.5240250,-25.0157878,0 -65.5232092,-25.0190909,0 -65.5317023,-25.0269490,0 -65.5343061,-25.0264946,0 -65.5359083,-25.0258518,0 -65.5367106,-25.0252064,0 -65.5376893,-25.0249665,0 -65.5418671,-25.0248175,0 -65.5431122,-25.0245784,0 -65.5450699,-25.0239365,0 -65.5474711,-25.0235390,0 -65.5485382,-25.0233803,0 -65.551204